function TropicalMatVec(A, x):
    for i = 1 to n:
        result[i] = +∞
        for j = 1 to n:
            result[i] = min(result[i], A[i,j] + x[j])
    return result

Complexity: O(n²) time, O(n) space

function MinCycleMean(W):
    D[0][v] = 0 for all v
    for k = 1 to n:
        for v = 1 to n:
            D[k][v] = min_u (D[k-1][u] + W[u][v])
    λ* = min_v max_{k<n} (D[n][v] - D[k][v]) / (n - k)
    return λ*

Complexity: O(n³) time, O(n²) space
